| Peripheral / Sensor | Module Pin | ESP32 GPIO | Logic Level | Power Rail | Protocol / Circuit Role |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **INMP441 Digital Mic** | VDD | — | — | 3.3V (~1.4mA) | Core Power |
| | GND | — | — | GND (0V) | Common Ground |
| | SD | **GPIO 32** | 3.3V | — | I2S Data Line |
| | WS | **GPIO 25** | 3.3V | — | I2S Word Select (LRCLK) |
| | SCK | **GPIO 33** | 3.3V | — | I2S Continuous Bit Clock |
| | L/R | — | — | GND (0V) | Channel Config (Left Channel) |
| **NEO-6M GPS Module** | VCC | — | — | 3.3V / 5V | Core Power (~45mA) |
| | GND | — | — | GND (0V) | Common Ground |
| | TX | **GPIO 16** | 3.3V | — | UART RX2 (Hardware Serial) |
| | RX | **GPIO 17** | 3.3V | — | UART TX2 (Hardware Serial) |
| **SIM800L Cellular** | VCC | — | — | **3.7V–4.2V** | **Direct LiPo Power (2A Peak)** |
| | GND | — | — | GND (0V) | **Must Share Common Ground** |
| | TX | **GPIO 26** | 3.3V | — | UART RX1 (Hardware Serial) |
| | RX | **GPIO 27** | 3.3V | — | UART TX1 (Hardware Serial) |
| **MAX30102 Wrist PPG** | VCC | — | — | 3.3V (~600µA) | Core Power |
| | GND | — | — | GND (0V) | Common Ground |
| | SDA | **GPIO 21** | 3.3V | — | I2C Data Line (Pull-Up) |
| | SCL | **GPIO 22** | 3.3V | — | I2C Clock Line (Pull-Up) |
| **Anti-Tamper Circuit**| Interlock | **GPIO 5** | 3.3V | Pull-Up 3.3V| Hardware Interrupt (Detachment) |
| **Manual SOS Switch** | Signal | **GPIO 4** | 3.3V | Pull-Up 3.3V| Physical Override Switch |

